  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First Individual Operation under the CCLIP for the Financing of Sustainable Electric Transportation in Ecuador</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Primera Operacion Individual bajo la CCLIP para el Financiamiento del Transporte Elctrico Sostenible en Ecuador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo de la CCLIP es reducir el consumo de combustibles fsiles y emisiones de Gases de Efecto Invernadero (GEI) en Ecuador mediante la promocin de inversiones en Vehculos Elctricos (VE). Los objetivos especficos de desarrollo para esta operacin sern: (i) estimular el financiamiento de inversiones privadas en VE; y (ii) fomentar el reemplazo de Vehculos de Combustin Interna (VCI).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of reducing the consumption of fossil fuels and GHG emissions in Ecuador by promoting low-carbon mobility. The specific development objectives for this operation will be: (i) stimulate the financing of private investments in EVs through CFN and CONAFIPS second-tier lines; and (ii) encourage the replacement of Internal Combustion Vehicles (IVC).</narrative>
  </description>
